                <h3>Are massage chairs worth it?</h3>
                <p>A premium massage chair is worth it for buyers who want regular at-home comfort, relaxation, and a more convenient wellness routine. The real value depends on comfort, fit, feature quality, and the ownership experience around delivery, warranty, and support.</p>
