                <h3>What is the best massage chair for home use?</h3>
                <p>The best massage chair for home use depends on body fit, preferred massage feel, room compatibility, and feature priorities such as zero gravity, 3D or 4D rollers, stretching, heat, and full-body air compression.</p>
            </div>
